WEBVTT

01:40.800 --> 01:43.320
GOVERNOR'S MANSION

01:45.840 --> 01:46.680
This way, please.

01:57.880 --> 01:58.920
The governor is upright.

01:59.000 --> 02:00.360
He doesn't care for expensive flowers,

02:00.440 --> 02:02.440
but he did keep these wildflowers.

02:04.880 --> 02:06.640
Undying Flower.

02:11.080 --> 02:12.720
I won't die.

02:20.160 --> 02:23.080
Your Highnesses, this way, please.

02:25.520 --> 02:26.720
Let's go.

02:34.720 --> 02:36.640
Your Highnesses, please come in.

03:40.280 --> 03:43.360
Welcome to Qingzhou,

03:44.480 --> 03:45.680
Your Highnesses.

03:46.520 --> 03:47.520
How

03:48.880 --> 03:50.360
have you been?

03:52.800 --> 03:54.120
Greetings, Your Excellency.

03:58.200 --> 03:59.320
How have you been?

04:02.840 --> 04:03.720
I'm fine.

04:14.320 --> 04:17.480
I didn't expect Your Highness
to be the governor.

04:17.560 --> 04:19.320
It really is a small world.

04:19.399 --> 04:22.640
Your Highness and I
both have deep ties with Qingzhou.

04:23.240 --> 04:25.520
And the Princess Heir is from Qingzhou.

04:26.640 --> 04:29.840
Perhaps it was destiny
that brought us back together here.

04:30.880 --> 04:34.440
Since Your Highnesses
are all old acquaintances,

04:34.520 --> 04:36.040
this matter should be easier.

04:36.640 --> 04:37.840
As long as Your Highnesses work together,

04:37.920 --> 04:40.560
Qingzhou is sure to become
the most prosperous place on the border.

04:40.640 --> 04:41.960
The border trade in Qingzhou will shape

04:42.040 --> 04:44.320
the success or failure of trade relations
between our two nations.

04:44.400 --> 04:47.480
Great Yan has set up
a Border Trade Supervision Office,

04:47.560 --> 04:50.200
and Mr. Li Jie is its first supervisor.

04:51.040 --> 04:53.560
From now on, all matters
concerning Xiyan merchants

04:53.640 --> 04:55.280
can be handled
at the Border Trade Supervision Office.

04:56.880 --> 04:59.000
Moreover, your personal involvement,
Your Highness,

04:59.080 --> 05:01.440
in negotiating the border trade matters

05:01.520 --> 05:02.840
demonstrates Xiyan's sincere commitment.

05:03.560 --> 05:06.200
When discussing the specifics,
I, too, will strive

05:06.280 --> 05:08.440
to work closely with Your Highness

05:08.520 --> 05:09.960
to secure mutual benefit for both nations.

05:13.640 --> 05:14.480
Your Excellency,

05:15.080 --> 05:16.600
here are several key issues

05:16.680 --> 05:19.080
listed by Xiyan
for this border trade negotiation.

05:19.160 --> 05:20.560
Please review them.

05:21.360 --> 05:24.200
Xiyan places great importance
on border trade

05:24.280 --> 05:25.400
and hopes to establish shops in Qingzhou

05:26.000 --> 05:27.680
for the indigenous people of Xiyan.

05:28.360 --> 05:32.000
Along with me on this visit to Qingzhou
is a group of merchants.

05:32.080 --> 05:33.880
Among them is the owner

05:33.960 --> 05:35.720
of the highly prestigious
Yanlai Fragrance Shop in Xiyan,

05:35.800 --> 05:38.640
which also hopes
to open a branch in Qingzhou.

05:39.240 --> 05:41.840
Your Excellency, we hope
that favorable policies can be enacted

05:41.920 --> 05:42.960
within the Qingzhou Chamber of Commerce.

05:43.040 --> 05:45.880
If the road is not passable,
profit will not flow.

05:45.960 --> 05:49.360
"If Xiyan and Great Yan
can build an official road,

05:49.440 --> 05:51.040
it will benefit generations to come."

05:52.080 --> 05:55.880
Your Highness, this proposal
aligns perfectly with my vision.

05:56.520 --> 05:59.440
I believe the border trade with Xiyan
will surely proceed smoothly.

06:04.280 --> 06:05.880
Your Highness, I have long heard
that you are a master of Weiqi.

06:06.480 --> 06:08.440
Many of the elders in the city
share your passion

06:08.520 --> 06:10.040
and have long admired Your Highness.

06:10.120 --> 06:11.480
I humbly invite Your Highness

06:11.560 --> 06:13.200
to engage in a match
with a top Weiqi player.

06:13.280 --> 06:16.280
It'll add a fine story to the Weiqi world
of both Great Yan and Xiyan.

06:19.720 --> 06:21.000
You flatter me.

06:21.080 --> 06:23.320
I merely play occasionally
in my free time.

06:23.400 --> 06:25.360
But since I have earned
the favor of the Weiqi masters,

06:25.440 --> 06:26.520
it would be rude of me to refuse.

06:26.600 --> 06:27.920
Your Highness, please.

06:29.480 --> 06:32.560
Your Highness, the room is too stuffy.

06:32.640 --> 06:33.640
I'll go out to get some fresh air.

07:10.320 --> 07:11.560
No matter how I tried to mend it,

07:12.280 --> 07:14.000
I couldn't erase

07:14.840 --> 07:16.600
the crack on this stone hairpin.

07:40.840 --> 07:42.880
A broken stone hairpin
will always bear a crack,

07:44.760 --> 07:46.200
no matter how you fix it.

07:49.560 --> 07:50.840
Your Excellency,

07:52.440 --> 07:54.400
you don't have to waste
any more effort on it.

07:56.880 --> 07:57.800
I'm sorry.

07:59.040 --> 07:59.960
I didn't take good care of it.

08:00.040 --> 08:02.040
Perhaps it wasn't that sturdy
to begin with

08:04.200 --> 08:06.160
and was bound to break sooner or later.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.840
What happened in the past

08:18.160 --> 08:19.640
was Prince Jing's debt

08:23.040 --> 08:24.280
to the peace-making Beauty, Mei Lin.

08:27.360 --> 08:28.400
Now,

08:33.360 --> 08:35.400
I'm the Princess Heir of Xiyan.

08:38.080 --> 08:39.799
Your Excellency, you owe me nothing.

10:00.000 --> 10:01.080
Father,

10:02.720 --> 10:03.720
Mother,

10:05.040 --> 10:06.800
it's time for me to move on.

10:43.680 --> 10:45.520
Moving forward will always lead
to diverging paths.

10:46.160 --> 10:48.640
Your Excellency,
why burden yourself and others?

10:53.280 --> 10:54.520
You worry too much, Your Highness.

10:54.600 --> 10:57.080
I know how to walk the road ahead.

10:58.800 --> 10:59.920
I'm glad.

11:01.640 --> 11:03.960
I just wanted to offer a kind reminder.

11:04.880 --> 11:06.960
And I, in turn,
must remind you, Your Highness,

11:07.040 --> 11:09.560
not to forget the vow you made,

11:09.640 --> 11:11.440
to never force her into anything.

11:11.520 --> 11:13.440
When it comes to keeping one's word,

11:13.520 --> 11:15.440
you don't seem to have the right
to remind me.

11:17.480 --> 11:19.800
The Snow Dragon Whisker
will bloom in a month.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.320
By then,

11:21.920 --> 11:24.840
the poison you planted in her
will be neutralized.

11:25.440 --> 11:26.800
After the detoxification,

11:26.880 --> 11:29.680
Mei Lin can choose where to go.

11:30.720 --> 11:34.520
But how do you know
she won't choose to stay in Xiyan

11:34.600 --> 11:36.560
and remain as my Princess Heir?

11:39.200 --> 11:40.240
It's late.

11:40.840 --> 11:43.200
Your Excellency, you should return
to the mansion and rest.

11:49.440 --> 11:51.960
SHOP

11:58.720 --> 11:59.880
Come on. Put this on.

12:05.400 --> 12:09.240
CAKE SHOP

12:10.720 --> 12:11.560
Mei Lin,

12:12.520 --> 12:14.800
the night road is full of risks.
Don't look back.

12:16.280 --> 12:17.880
Focus on the path ahead

12:20.200 --> 12:21.640
and keep moving forward.

12:25.040 --> 12:27.600
Some memories are etched into the bones.

12:29.800 --> 12:31.240
They are hard to forget.

12:34.840 --> 12:37.920
I look back
to see the road I've walked clearly

12:39.000 --> 12:40.800
and to make sure I don't take
the wrong steps again.

12:46.200 --> 12:49.600
Didn't you say the road
would get brighter the further we went?

12:50.880 --> 12:52.760
The border trade is about to begin.

12:52.840 --> 12:54.400
Everything will go as planned.

12:56.160 --> 12:59.360
By the way,
Jia's fragrance shop is about to open.

12:59.440 --> 13:01.960
She invited us to pick sachets
in the woods tomorrow.

13:03.440 --> 13:04.840
Pick sachets in the woods?

13:06.160 --> 13:07.640
Fragrance shops are everywhere in Xiyan.

13:07.720 --> 13:10.520
This is a common way to attract customers.

13:11.200 --> 13:13.080
But Jia is really clever.

13:13.760 --> 13:15.600
By being her first customers,

13:15.680 --> 13:16.880
we'll probably end up
giving her business advice,

13:17.960 --> 13:21.120
and in return, we'll only get
some free scented sachets.

13:21.680 --> 13:23.160
The first customers?

13:23.840 --> 13:25.480
Well, I have a good sense of smell.

13:25.560 --> 13:26.520
Jia might not get the better deal here.

13:34.960 --> 13:38.360
CALLIGRAPHY AND PAINTING SERVICES

13:40.400 --> 13:41.240
Mei Lin,

13:43.480 --> 13:46.120
she seems to have invited
the governor too.

13:49.360 --> 13:52.240
No one knows Qingzhou better
than he does now.

13:54.000 --> 13:56.160
Jia is really smart.

13:56.240 --> 13:58.360
Her business is bound to flourish.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.040
Small pendants.

14:27.120 --> 14:29.200
Come and take a look!

14:29.280 --> 14:30.800
Take a look at the fans.

14:30.880 --> 14:32.920
Miss, make sure to eat these pastries
as soon as you get home.

14:33.000 --> 14:34.040
Thank you.

14:37.880 --> 14:40.000
RONGJIN SILK FABRICS

14:40.080 --> 14:40.920
Please come in.

14:41.000 --> 14:42.080
Come and take a look.

14:43.560 --> 14:44.720
With abundant resources and prosperity,

14:44.800 --> 14:46.280
the people live in peace and contentment.

14:46.360 --> 14:48.840
Our efforts have finally paid off.

14:48.920 --> 14:49.760
Exactly.

14:50.760 --> 14:51.800
PHOENIX MARROW FRAGRANCE, THREE TAELS

14:51.880 --> 14:53.280
AROMATIC DRAGON BORNEOL, THREE TAELS

14:53.360 --> 14:55.040
HERBAL TEA FRAGRANCE, THREE TAELS

14:55.120 --> 14:56.240
LILY FRAGRANCE, THREE TAELS

15:04.920 --> 15:06.160
Musk.

15:07.360 --> 15:08.480
Agarwood.

15:10.600 --> 15:12.680
Where is the stool? Big Guy!

15:13.600 --> 15:15.480
- Bring me a stool.
- Okay.

15:21.720 --> 15:22.720
What's the matter?

15:22.800 --> 15:24.240
I want to hang these scented sachets up,

15:24.320 --> 15:25.680
but it's a bit too high. I can't reach it.

15:26.320 --> 15:27.240
You don't need a stool.

15:29.080 --> 15:30.440
Awesome.

15:30.520 --> 15:31.880
I knew you were strong,

15:31.960 --> 15:34.360
but I didn't expect you to be this strong.

15:34.440 --> 15:36.120
It shows I haven't been wasting my meals.

15:36.200 --> 15:37.880
- A bit higher.
- Alright.

15:39.240 --> 15:41.880
Miss, we'll need to hang up
the shop sign later.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.400
The shop sign is heavy. Let me do it.

15:46.280 --> 15:48.640
I'm the shopkeeper.
I need to hang the sign myself.

15:48.720 --> 15:52.160
If I can't even handle the sign,
how can I run this shop?

15:53.600 --> 15:54.440
Alright.

15:56.560 --> 15:58.520
I'm off to see the governor
in the woods then.

15:59.680 --> 16:01.160
I don't understand it.

16:01.240 --> 16:03.400
Why do you have to see the governor?

16:04.520 --> 16:06.040
When I first came to Qingzhou,

16:06.120 --> 16:07.680
the shop wasn't doing well,

16:07.760 --> 16:08.880
and I could barely make any money.

16:09.480 --> 16:11.960
The food was bad,
and I was so hungry, I lost weight.

16:13.120 --> 16:14.720
But after the governor came,

16:14.800 --> 16:16.160
things in Qingzhou got better day by day,

16:16.240 --> 16:17.560
and we started earning more money.

16:17.640 --> 16:20.600
I want to thank the governor
for helping me get enough to eat.

16:22.120 --> 16:24.280
The person you should thank
the most is me.

16:24.360 --> 16:25.560
It's me who pays your salary.

16:25.640 --> 16:26.880
No.

16:26.960 --> 16:28.480
The person I should be most thankful to
is still the governor.

16:29.640 --> 16:31.440
Had it not been for what he's done,

16:31.520 --> 16:33.160
there wouldn't have been
Yanlai Fragrance Shop,

16:33.720 --> 16:36.240
and I wouldn't have met
such a kind shopkeeper like you.

16:50.840 --> 16:51.960
Jia said

16:52.840 --> 16:55.160
that if I follow the scent I truly desire

16:55.240 --> 16:57.960
and stay loyal to it,
I'll surely get the result I want.

18:19.360 --> 18:21.520
Your Excellency, you picked
this sachet first.

18:23.120 --> 18:24.560
I have no reason to take it from you.

18:24.640 --> 18:26.800
This is also the scent
you picked at the very beginning.

18:36.880 --> 18:37.720
Now,

18:39.120 --> 18:40.600
this scented sachet suits me better.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.520
Ms. Mei Lin!

18:47.640 --> 18:48.520
Wei.

18:49.120 --> 18:50.080
What are you doing here?

18:50.720 --> 18:52.800
The shopkeeper said
the governor and Xiyan's Prince Heir

18:52.880 --> 18:54.520
and Princess Heir were in the woods.

18:54.600 --> 18:57.040
Are you the Prince Heir
and Princess Heir of Xiyan?

18:59.520 --> 19:00.800
You're mistaken, Wei.

19:02.440 --> 19:03.440
He's the governor.

19:04.280 --> 19:05.840
You're the governor?

19:06.400 --> 19:07.680
Then you must be the governor's wife.

19:08.600 --> 19:10.680
- I…
- Big Guy!

19:11.560 --> 19:13.880
Your Excellency,
Your Highness, please forgive us.

19:13.960 --> 19:15.440
He's a resident laborer
in my fragrance shop.

19:15.520 --> 19:17.840
- He's a little slow in the head.
- You're the Princess Heir?

19:18.600 --> 19:19.440
Are you not with him anymore?

19:20.440 --> 19:21.960
Aren't you two a couple?

19:28.280 --> 19:29.120
Mei Lin.

19:31.360 --> 19:32.480
The Prince Heir of Xiyan is here.

19:32.560 --> 19:34.680
If you don't want to die,
go and attend to other officials.

19:39.920 --> 19:42.320
Dear noble guests, have you all found
the scented sachet you like?

19:46.120 --> 19:48.760
Your Highnesses, you truly have
a destined romance.

19:50.320 --> 19:53.040
In the woods, this is the only pair
of matching sachets.

19:53.120 --> 19:55.040
Together, they are called
Lianli Fragrance.

19:55.120 --> 19:57.320
The two sachets look alike,

19:57.400 --> 20:00.000
but their scents differ slightly,
perfectly complementing each other.

20:00.600 --> 20:03.920
They symbolize unity
and lifelong companionship,

20:04.000 --> 20:06.160
which is why they are beloved

20:06.240 --> 20:08.040
by young couples in Xiyan.

20:09.960 --> 20:12.240
I wish Your Highnesses lifelong union.

20:18.920 --> 20:20.520
Your Excellency, you truly have
a sharp sense of smell.

20:21.520 --> 20:23.640
This sachet is called
Lone Butterfly's Dance.

20:23.720 --> 20:25.880
There is only a single type
of wildflower inside.

20:25.960 --> 20:29.400
It's really hard to find
in such a vast wood.

20:31.760 --> 20:35.160
These small, unassuming wildflowers,
from a distance,

20:36.360 --> 20:38.680
look like butterflies
dancing alone in the air.

20:41.640 --> 20:42.840
It's a very fitting name.

20:44.440 --> 20:46.240
Now that you have chosen
the sachets you like,

20:46.320 --> 20:48.280
- please have a rest in the pavilion.
- Alright.

21:03.880 --> 21:07.120
LONE BUTTERFLY'S DANCE
WHILE YOU LIVE, YOUR LOVE REMAINS

21:09.480 --> 21:10.360
TAICHI PALACE

21:10.440 --> 21:11.600
Four million taels?

21:11.680 --> 21:13.960
Great Yan and Xiyan
have already ceased hostilities.

21:14.600 --> 21:17.040
What does the Ministry of Defense
need so much military funding for?

21:17.640 --> 21:21.080
Are you even planning to reduce
the regular military budget?

21:21.160 --> 21:22.320
Even though the world is at peace,

21:22.400 --> 21:23.720
forgetting the need
for defense brings danger.

21:24.320 --> 21:27.000
Doesn't the Ministry of Revenue
understand such a simple principle?

21:27.720 --> 21:30.600
In any case, the four million taels
cannot be reduced.

21:30.680 --> 21:33.720
Even if there's no conflict
between Qingzhou and Xiyan,

21:33.800 --> 21:37.280
the Nanyue troops frequently harass
the border of Mozhou.

21:37.960 --> 21:38.840
If the Ministry of Revenue
withholds the funds

21:38.920 --> 21:40.760
and Mozhou is lost,

21:40.840 --> 21:43.760
can you, Minister Liu,
shoulder that responsibility?

21:44.880 --> 21:46.040
Don't change the subject.

21:46.640 --> 21:48.560
When did I say
we wouldn't provide the funds?

21:48.640 --> 21:51.160
As for the amount,
it needs to be discussed.

21:51.920 --> 21:54.520
Today, we are here to discuss details
of the Blessing Ceremony.

21:54.600 --> 21:56.000
What you two have mentioned

21:56.080 --> 21:58.840
can be reported in detail
during tomorrow's court session.

21:59.640 --> 22:01.200
You all have valid points.

22:02.040 --> 22:02.960
Let's take a break

22:04.000 --> 22:05.360
and discuss later.

22:09.560 --> 22:11.440
Concubine Yan, what brings you here?

22:11.520 --> 22:13.760
I've come to bring Your Majesty
some pastries.

22:20.600 --> 22:21.520
Please have a taste.

22:30.680 --> 22:31.520
It's tasty.

22:39.680 --> 22:40.800
What's the matter with you?

22:43.960 --> 22:44.800
I'm fine.

22:45.440 --> 22:48.560
I might have overeaten yesterday,
so I am feeling a bit sick.

22:48.640 --> 22:49.760
Please, Your Majesty, return inside.

22:50.640 --> 22:52.880
- I just need to take a walk.
- Okay.

23:02.120 --> 23:03.080
Wang Bao.

23:03.720 --> 23:04.720
Yes, Your Majesty.

23:06.400 --> 23:07.440
Though His Majesty is busy,

23:07.520 --> 23:09.520
he asks Your Highness
to bring him food every day.

23:09.600 --> 23:12.120
He really likes seeing you, Your Highness.

23:15.240 --> 23:16.320
Your Highness.

23:20.800 --> 23:23.720
Your Highness, His Majesty ordered
this imperial physician

23:23.800 --> 23:25.320
to check your pulse for your well-being.

23:40.320 --> 23:42.600
YANLAI FRAGRANCE SHOP

23:42.680 --> 23:43.640
We're open now.

23:43.720 --> 23:45.880
Feel free to come in
and pick scented sachets.

23:45.960 --> 23:48.120
This is the first fragrance shop
in Qingzhou.

23:54.960 --> 23:56.320
- Over here.
- Free scented sachets

23:56.400 --> 23:57.360
from Yanlai Fragrance Shop!

23:57.440 --> 23:59.320
- Come and take a look.
- Yanlai Fragrance Shop.

23:59.400 --> 24:01.000
- Come and take a look.
- Free insect-repellent sachets!

24:01.080 --> 24:02.840
- Insect-repellent sachets from Yanlai.
- Come and take a look.

24:02.920 --> 24:04.600
Come and take a look.

24:06.320 --> 24:09.360
- Insect-repellent sachets from Yanlai.
- It's for free.

24:09.440 --> 24:11.240
Come and take a look.

24:11.320 --> 24:12.720
- Your Highness, this is a great idea.
- Insect-repellent sachets!

24:12.800 --> 24:13.960
- It's for free.
- This way, we can help Qingzhou

24:14.040 --> 24:15.920
- solve its pest control issues
- Everyone can get one.

24:16.000 --> 24:18.240
- Please come and get one.
- and get them to accept us more quickly.

24:18.320 --> 24:20.280
Come and take a look! It's for free.

24:20.360 --> 24:21.640
Come and take a look!

24:21.720 --> 24:23.960
- Insect-repellent sachets from Yanlai.
- Free insect-repellent sachets.

24:24.040 --> 24:25.640
- The sachets are poisonous!
- It's for free.

24:25.720 --> 24:27.360
The sachets are poisonous!

24:27.440 --> 24:28.640
- Don't keep them.
- What happened?

24:28.720 --> 24:29.840
- The sachets are poisonous.
- How could they be?

24:30.440 --> 24:31.520
Zhuang smelled
your scented sachets yesterday,

24:31.600 --> 24:34.320
and today, he is like this.

24:37.680 --> 24:39.000
Impossible.

24:39.080 --> 24:40.880
Don't look!

24:41.560 --> 24:44.040
What am I supposed to do about Zhuang?

24:44.120 --> 24:45.680
The sachets must be poisonous.

24:45.760 --> 24:46.600
Madam,

24:47.200 --> 24:49.080
the child seems to have contracted
toxic moth fever.

24:50.560 --> 24:53.240
Madam, the symptoms appear
three or four days after the bite.

24:53.320 --> 24:54.440
You used the sachet too late.

24:54.520 --> 24:55.920
You're still trying to justify yourselves.

24:56.000 --> 24:56.960
You're not selling scented sachets.

24:57.040 --> 24:57.920
You're selling poison!

24:58.000 --> 25:00.520
Scented sachets can repel insects,
but they can't cure illnesses.

25:00.600 --> 25:02.000
Your grandson needs to be sent
to a clinic right now.

25:02.080 --> 25:03.400
We can go with you.

25:03.480 --> 25:04.800
Don't believe these Xiyan people!

25:04.880 --> 25:06.360
Who knows if they are helping us
or harming us?

25:06.440 --> 25:07.480
- Yeah.
- With them around,

25:07.560 --> 25:08.920
- your grandson's condition might worsen.
- Right.

25:09.000 --> 25:10.760
- Exactly!
- Send him to the clinic first.

25:10.840 --> 25:12.120
Don't, Madam.

25:12.200 --> 25:13.320
Don't listen to her nonsense.

25:13.400 --> 25:15.720
Yesterday, I saw the mass murderer
governor entering this shop.

25:15.800 --> 25:17.840
These scented sachets
are probably used to poison us!

25:17.920 --> 25:18.920
- That's right! I saw it too.
- Right!

25:19.000 --> 25:21.680
These Xiyan people are trying to harm
us Qingzhou residents!

25:21.760 --> 25:22.720
- That's right.
- Yeah.

25:22.800 --> 25:24.200
- What should we do?
- Right.

25:24.280 --> 25:25.120
They are so evil!

25:25.200 --> 25:26.920
They won't even spare little children!

25:27.000 --> 25:28.280
What's your relationship
with the mass murderer?

25:28.360 --> 25:29.640
Are you in cahoots with him?

25:29.720 --> 25:31.000
Are you trying to harm us?

25:31.080 --> 25:32.200
The mass murderer is going
to massacre the city again!

25:32.280 --> 25:34.200
- I'll fight you!
- Fight you!

25:35.800 --> 25:36.640
What are you doing?

25:36.720 --> 25:38.800
- What are you doing?
- My poor Zhuang…

25:38.880 --> 25:39.880
Come on.

25:39.960 --> 25:41.160
Calm down.

25:41.920 --> 25:43.080
Stop pushing.

25:44.000 --> 25:46.280
Mr. Li said you were not welcome
in Qinglin Lane.

25:46.360 --> 25:47.200
Hurry and leave!

25:47.280 --> 25:48.040
- Go!
- Hurry and go!

25:48.120 --> 25:49.840
Don't pretend to be merciful.

25:49.920 --> 25:51.120
Leave!

25:51.200 --> 25:53.000
- Go!
- Leave our Qinglin Lane.

25:53.080 --> 25:54.880
Mr. Li is the old man
who threw stones at you.

25:54.960 --> 25:56.600
He has considerable prestige
in Qinglin Lane,

25:56.680 --> 25:57.760
and all the neighbors listen to him.

25:59.280 --> 26:01.320
Mass murderer, go!

26:01.400 --> 26:02.240
- Hurry and go!
- Go away!

26:02.320 --> 26:05.520
- Hurry and go!
- Leave here. Go!

26:09.200 --> 26:10.440
Please quiet down.

26:11.040 --> 26:12.200
I'm also from Qingzhou.

26:15.040 --> 26:18.160
Madam, I'm the daughter of Mr. Mei,
a mason in Qinglin Lane.

26:19.040 --> 26:20.120
I won't harm my fellow townspeople.

26:21.480 --> 26:22.320
Can Zhuang

26:23.160 --> 26:25.800
really recover?

26:26.400 --> 26:28.800
I promise you
I'll have someone cure Zhuang.

26:29.520 --> 26:31.080
Take them to Fuxin Clinic

26:31.680 --> 26:34.040
and have a physician cure her grandson.

26:34.120 --> 26:35.640
- Yes.
- Go ahead.

26:42.480 --> 26:44.920
- Don't worry.
- Okay.

26:54.400 --> 26:55.360
Don't worry.

26:56.440 --> 26:59.480
The Fuxin Clinic has an imperial physician
I brought from the palace.

26:59.560 --> 27:00.920
Zhuang will be fine.

27:05.400 --> 27:07.120
- Go. You're not welcome here!
- Leave here!

27:07.200 --> 27:08.960
- Get lost!
- Qingyan.

27:12.000 --> 27:13.520
- Dear fellow townspeople,
- Hurry and go!

27:13.600 --> 27:15.360
the purpose of engraving
the Monument of the Masses

27:15.440 --> 27:17.840
is to pray for the souls
of those who perished in Qingzhou.

27:17.920 --> 27:19.960
I hope everyone
will not misunderstand anymore.

27:20.040 --> 27:21.160
We don't trust you!

27:21.240 --> 27:22.280
- Right!
- We don't trust you!

27:22.360 --> 27:24.760
Go! Whatever you say, we won't believe it!

27:24.840 --> 27:26.040
- Beat him to death!
- We don't believe you!

27:26.120 --> 27:27.400
Your Excellency!

27:28.920 --> 27:30.160
Your Excellency.

27:30.840 --> 27:32.400
The people are surrounding
the Prince Heir and Princess Heir of Xiyan

27:32.480 --> 27:33.360
at the door of Yanlai Fragrance Shop.

27:34.240 --> 27:35.160
Go!

27:44.560 --> 27:46.760
I can understand why the Qingzhou people
don't like the Xiyan people.

27:46.840 --> 27:49.000
But why do they hate the governor so much?

27:49.080 --> 27:50.640
Don't ask what you shouldn't.

27:50.720 --> 27:51.640
Go ahead and work.

27:51.720 --> 27:54.800
The grievances of Qingzhou
should not be borne by the governor.

27:55.560 --> 27:57.920
But deep-seated issues
are not formed in a single day.

27:59.200 --> 28:00.560
The Qingzhou people

28:00.640 --> 28:03.280
have long been holding grudges
against the governor and Xiyan.

28:04.080 --> 28:05.960
It's not easy to change people's hearts.

28:06.760 --> 28:09.080
Your Highness and the governor
both want what's best for Qingzhou.

28:09.160 --> 28:11.920
In time, the people will come to see that.

28:13.000 --> 28:14.680
- I can already see it.
- So can I.

28:18.000 --> 28:20.760
As long as we keep at it,
people's hearts can be changed.

28:23.520 --> 28:24.640
Mei Lin is right.

28:25.480 --> 28:27.680
As long as we persist, the Qingzhou people

28:27.760 --> 28:29.680
will one day understand
our good intentions.

28:30.600 --> 28:31.760
I believe that too.

28:41.720 --> 28:42.720
I have a way that can help

28:43.920 --> 28:47.120
ease the issue
of insect-borne fevers in Qingzhou

28:47.200 --> 28:49.520
and also change the people's
prejudices against us.

28:54.480 --> 28:55.440
What did you just say?

28:56.920 --> 28:58.680
Concubine Yan is pregnant.

28:59.720 --> 29:01.920
However, is there a problem
with the pregnancy?

29:02.880 --> 29:05.840
With her condition, she'll probably suffer
during her pregnancy.

29:09.640 --> 29:10.600
Her well-being

29:12.160 --> 29:13.800
must come first, above all else.

29:15.320 --> 29:16.480
But she…

29:16.560 --> 29:17.520
Your Majesty!

29:18.200 --> 29:19.280
Your Majesty.

29:22.800 --> 29:25.040
Your Majesty, I'm going to be a mother.

29:29.280 --> 29:30.200
Aren't you happy?

29:30.280 --> 29:31.720
Yes, I am.

29:33.680 --> 29:34.560
You are lying.

29:35.880 --> 29:38.040
I'm just worried you'll suffer.

29:38.120 --> 29:41.160
Your Majesty, I am in very good health.

29:41.840 --> 29:45.200
Even if something happens,
the gods will protect me.

29:45.840 --> 29:47.400
Alright. Sit down.

29:49.640 --> 29:54.440
My mother often said bearing children
was always hard work.

29:54.520 --> 29:55.440
I'm not afraid.

29:57.560 --> 29:59.160
Anyway, he is in my womb,

30:00.360 --> 30:01.640
so I get the final say.

30:01.720 --> 30:03.080
Alright.

30:03.680 --> 30:04.680
You get the final say.

30:05.960 --> 30:06.800
Your Majesty,

30:07.520 --> 30:09.800
now I have one more relative in Great Yan.

30:10.600 --> 30:12.080
I'm really happy.

30:27.560 --> 30:31.120
PEACE AND TRANQUILITY PREVAIL

30:32.840 --> 30:35.880
Your Excellency,
I traveled all over Qingzhou today,

30:35.960 --> 30:38.040
but I only gathered fewer than ten names.

30:38.120 --> 30:39.000
The residents of Baihua Lane,

30:39.080 --> 30:41.200
Lincui District, and Zhaohui Lane
all refused to cooperate

30:41.280 --> 30:43.000
with the construction
of the Monument of the Masses.

30:47.120 --> 30:48.120
- Get lost!
- Get lost!

30:48.200 --> 30:50.000
- Hurry and go!
- You're not welcome here!

30:57.320 --> 30:58.640
Stop.

31:14.760 --> 31:16.720
Mister, please kick the ball over.

31:25.600 --> 31:27.960
- Thank you, Mister.
- Thank you, Mister.

31:28.040 --> 31:29.800
Let's go play.

31:33.480 --> 31:36.360
As long as we keep at it,
people's hearts can be changed.

31:39.200 --> 31:40.680
As long as we keep at it,

31:41.760 --> 31:44.920
people's hearts
will definitely be changed.

31:51.320 --> 31:52.240
QINGZHOU POST

31:52.320 --> 31:53.160
What did you say?

31:54.000 --> 31:55.440
Yue Qin was besieged by the locals?

31:56.080 --> 31:57.720
The Qingzhou people hate Murong Jinghe.

31:57.800 --> 31:59.320
Now that Yue Qin is overseeing
the border trade,

31:59.400 --> 32:01.600
in people's minds, he is in cahoots
with the mass murderer.

32:07.280 --> 32:08.880
In that case,

32:08.960 --> 32:10.920
the Qingzhou people

32:11.480 --> 32:14.840
must hate Yue Qin to the bones too.

32:16.440 --> 32:17.400
FENGCAO PAVILION

32:17.480 --> 32:19.640
The Artemisia you sent yesterday
to ward off poisonous insects

32:19.720 --> 32:20.640
has indeed proven effective.

32:20.720 --> 32:22.960
The people were very grateful
upon learning that the herbs

32:23.040 --> 32:23.920
were provided by you, Your Excellency.

32:24.600 --> 32:26.440
Several villagers even left the names
of their deceased loved ones voluntarily

32:26.520 --> 32:28.840
after obtaining the medicine.

32:29.520 --> 32:31.240
Your dedication to serving the people

32:31.320 --> 32:33.160
will gradually be understood by them.

32:36.640 --> 32:37.480
Thank you for your hard work.

32:38.280 --> 32:39.320
If you run out of herbs,

32:39.400 --> 32:41.480
you can come directly to the yamen
and find Mr. Li.

32:41.560 --> 32:43.840
Don't worry, Your Excellency.
I understand.

32:49.680 --> 32:51.520
My lord, it is reported

32:51.600 --> 32:53.720
that Mingju's agents,
disguised as common folk,

32:53.800 --> 32:55.800
have been spotted near the mines
around Qingzhou.

32:55.880 --> 32:57.840
Mingju was once defeated by you, my lord.

32:57.920 --> 32:59.080
Could he be here seeking revenge?

33:01.160 --> 33:03.520
Mingju is a leader of the pro-war faction.

33:03.600 --> 33:06.560
If Yue Qin successfully
promotes border trade

33:06.640 --> 33:08.080
this time,

33:08.160 --> 33:11.360
his influence within the Xiyan court
will overshadow that of Mingju.

33:12.480 --> 33:15.080
You mean Mingju
is targeting the Prince Heir?

33:32.640 --> 33:33.840
You're sharp as always.

33:33.920 --> 33:36.160
Buying scented sachets
and hanging them in the mines

33:36.240 --> 33:37.720
can not only help Jia expand sales

33:38.320 --> 33:39.840
but also help the miners repel insects.

33:46.400 --> 33:47.360
Actually,

33:48.640 --> 33:50.160
after we parted at the mine in Qingzhou,

33:50.240 --> 33:51.960
I looked for you for many years,

33:52.040 --> 33:54.200
and I visited this mine countless times.

33:56.280 --> 33:57.320
I remember that back then,

33:58.600 --> 34:01.200
you were thinking about repaying me
for saving your life.

34:02.760 --> 34:05.560
But after that day,
I didn't dare to come back again.

34:07.960 --> 34:10.360
In this mine,
I would always think of my father.

34:11.800 --> 34:13.360
My father was a mason.

34:13.920 --> 34:16.719
He used to mine here
and stayed here all day long.

34:17.320 --> 34:19.600
When I was little,
I thought the mine was fun,

34:20.320 --> 34:22.320
and I often pestered him
to bring me here to play.

34:23.600 --> 34:26.199
So, that's why you knew the way out.

34:29.400 --> 34:32.960
After that day,
I thought I'd never come back again.

34:37.239 --> 34:38.440
Let's go.

35:06.840 --> 35:08.280
It's okay. Hurry and go.

35:08.360 --> 35:09.640
The exit is right ahead.

35:27.120 --> 35:29.040
There are many mines in the mountain.
Let's split up and search.

35:29.120 --> 35:30.000
Yes.

35:33.000 --> 35:35.360
Mei Lin! Mei Lin! Mei Lin!

35:36.440 --> 35:37.640
Mei Lin!

35:38.880 --> 35:40.000
Can you hear me?

35:43.560 --> 35:44.560
Mei Lin!

35:44.640 --> 35:45.480
Mei Lin!

35:46.160 --> 35:47.880
- Mei Lin!
- Your Highness.

35:47.960 --> 35:50.240
Mei Lin, I'll find a way to save you.

36:09.560 --> 36:10.680
Go, Your Highness.

36:10.760 --> 36:13.000
Mei Lin is still inside.
Go find another exit!

39:24.720 --> 39:27.120
Mei Lin!
